# Shared room state (REQUIRED on Vercel, optional locally). Attach an Upstash
# Redis store to the Vercel project (Storage → Marketplace → Upstash) and these
# are injected automatically; the legacy KV_REST_API_URL/TOKEN names also work.
# Locally, leave them unset and rooms live in the dev server's memory.
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=

# Required (later, for the live H3 fight feed). The server mints short-lived,
# session-scoped JWTs from this; the browser never sees the raw key. rk_... from
# https://www.reactor.inc/account/api-keys
REACTOR_API_KEY=

# Optional: AI-generated fighter portraits (Create Fighter -> Generate),
# served by /api/fighters/generate-image. Without it, upload-only.
# r8_... from https://replicate.com/account/api-tokens
# REPLICATE_API_KEY=

# Optional (later): the LLM narrative coordinator that resolves each round's
# two attacks into the next scene prompt.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini

# Optional in local dev: durable public URLs for uploaded/generated fighter
# images (H3 needs a real https URL). Without it, images fall back to data:
# URIs — fine for local screen flow, but NOT publicly reachable. Auto-populated
# by Vercel when a Blob store is attached to the project.
# BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN=
